cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the accompanying paper as in preparation, by Marcus Webb and Morgan
  Lynch-Davies, until a public version is available. When using this collection,
  also identify the actual commit or release used and relevant contribution history.
type: software
license: MIT
title: "SubGaussianTailBounds: Lean formalization of singular-value tail bounds"
authors:
  - family-names: Webb
    given-names: Marcus
repository-code: "https://github.com/marcusdavidwebb/SubGaussianTailBounds"
abstract: >-
  Complete Lean formalizations of two explicit sub-Gaussian singular-value
  tail bounds, including their finite numerical inequalities. The accompanying
  paper is Sharp tail bounds
  for the extreme singular values of sub-Gaussian matrices, by Marcus Webb and
  Morgan Lynch-Davies.
  The paper is in preparation and no public version is currently available.
  Attribution and assistance are recorded in the contribution history and
  provenance documentation. Identify the repository commit or release used
  independently of the paper's publication status.
